         ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: gnome-shell (>= 50~)
Description: OpenCode Go Widget for the GNOME desktop
 A panel ring gauge, dropdown and floating desktop card showing OpenCode Go
 usage for the rolling, weekly and monthly limits.
 .
 The GTK app owns the API key and polling, and feeds a bundled GNOME Shell
 extension over D-Bus. A tray-icon fallback is used when the extension is not
 enabled.
